1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
Send a Gmail thread to your AI.

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:06,000
Free, open source, runs on your computer.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,800
Tick the AIs you use.

4
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:12,000
Changes save straight away.

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,967
Right-click an email. Pick an AI.

6
00:00:14,967 --> 00:00:22,900
It opens the email and copies the thread.

7
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:28,800
Paste and read it.

8
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:34,367
Nothing is sent until you press Enter.

9
00:00:34,367 --> 00:00:38,200
Or tick several emails at once.

10
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:41,300
It reads each one without opening it.

11
00:00:41,300 --> 00:00:45,000
It asks the AI to sort them into tasks.

12
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:49,500
Or copy it for any AI.

13
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:52,900
Claude Code and Codex read it themselves.

14
00:00:52,900 --> 00:00:56,700
It gets the thread ID, not the message.

15
00:00:56,700 --> 00:00:59,800
No server, no account, no tracking.

16
00:00:59,800 --> 00:01:03,000
Change your AIs from the toolbar icon.
